WEBVTT

00:00:59.057 --> 00:01:01.255
(Applause)

00:01:01.279 --> 00:01:03.757
Happy 50th anniversary
on your flag, Canada.

00:01:03.781 --> 00:01:06.391
It is beautiful, gold standard.

00:01:06.415 --> 00:01:07.748
Love it.

00:01:07.772 --> 00:01:09.794
I'm kind of obsessed with flags.

00:01:10.386 --> 00:01:12.306
Sometimes I bring up the topic of flags,

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:15.924
and people are like,
"I don't care about flags,"

00:01:15.948 --> 00:01:19.270
and then we start talking
about flags, and trust me,

00:01:19.294 --> 00:01:21.822
100 percent of people care about flags.

00:01:21.846 --> 00:01:25.337
There's just something about them
that works on our emotions.

00:01:25.361 --> 00:01:29.388
My family wrapped my Christmas presents
as flags this year,

00:01:29.412 --> 00:01:36.168
including the blue gift bag
that's dressed up as the flag of Scotland.